
---

## **.gitignore**

Here’s a `.gitignore` file to exclude unnecessary files and folders:

```plaintext
# Node.js
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
package-lock.json

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production

# IDE/Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build files
dist/
build/

# OS-specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Misc
*.swp
*.swo